<title>RUSSIA: Russia to auction 12 trln rbls T-bills June 4.</title>
<headline>Russia to auction 12 trln rbls T-bills June 4.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Finance Ministry will auction 7.50 trillion roubles of 226-day GKO discount Treasury bills (series 21073) and an additional 4.50 trillion rouble 133-day tranche of the series 22082 bills on June 4, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow:</p>
<p>Full details of the series 21073 auction:</p>
<p>    Issue volume			7.50 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		     1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date			  June 4, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor				 266 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		     Feb 25, 1998</p>
<p>Full details of the new tranche auction:</p>
<p>    Series number		     22082</p>
<p>    Issue volume			4.50 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		     1.00 million</p>
<p>    Issue date			  June 4, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor (remaining)		 133 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date		     Oct 15, 1997</p>
<p>    Original issue date	     May 7, 1997</p>
<p>On June 4 the Finance Ministry will also repay about 8.92 trillion roubles in a maturing issue of 238-day T-bills (series 22053).</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
